OL,3,AEnergy bills forecast to go up by #443
OL,4,Aa year from January as UK inflation
OL,5,Arises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FGas and electricity bills are forecast
OL,8,Fto jump by #443 a year from January as
OL,9,Fenergy costs continue to push up the
OL,10,FUK's inflation rate.
OL,12,FThe annual price cap on gas and
OL,13,Felecrtricity is predicted to rise by
OL,14,F26% in the new year, according to
OL,15,Fresearchers at consultancy Cornwall
OL,16,FInsight. Energy regulator Ofgem will
OL,17,Fannounce the new cap next Wednesday, 25
OL,18,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
