OL,3,AEnergy bills forecast to go up by #443
OL,4,Aa year from January as UK inflation
OL,5,Arises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FA sharp jump means inflation is at risk
OL,8,Fof continuing to rise - official data
OL,9,Frevealed prices rose 3.6% in the year
OL,10,Fto October, up from 3.5% in September
OL,11,Fmainly because of higher petrol and
OL,12,Fdiesel prices.
OL,14,FInflation is at its highest rate in a
OL,15,Fyear as energy prices have accelerated
OL,16,Flargely due to the US-Israel war with
OL,17,FIran.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
