OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash on welfare
OL,4,Abill and youth unemployment at PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is facing Conservative
OL,7,Fleader Kemi Badenoch at Prime
OL,8,FMinister's Questions - watch live above
OL,10,FBadenoch focuses on the welfare bill -
OL,11,Fasking if it will be cut in this
OL,12,FParliament
OL,14,FBurnham says the Tory leader "only asks
OL,15,Ffor cuts" - and says the government
OL,16,Fwill work "as quickly as possible to
OL,17,Fget the welfare bill down"
OL,19,FThe prime minister began with a joke
OL,20,Fabout ChatGPT writing his notes - after
OL,21,Fa report that one of his speechwriters
OL,22,Fused the tool
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
