OL,3,ARubio says US not 'under systemic
OL,4,Aattack' after series of tech outages
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are not under systemic attack," he
OL,7,Fsaid. "These events, one has nothing to
OL,8,Fdo with the other, they are not
OL,9,Finter-related."
OL,11,FCyber-security experts have agreed that
OL,12,Fthere is no evidence linking the
OL,13,Foutages, and many of the issues appear
OL,14,Fdue to updates to old infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
